31,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I have some information. Minato is human.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"A bold claim so early. If Toshio is the Seer, we have a starting point.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Minato,,"Oh! I'm human? Thank you for telling everyone, Toshio-san.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a helpful lead, provided the information is truthful.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Yes, I am the Seer. I intend to guide the village to victory.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,It's a risky claim. The werewolf or possessed could easily fake it.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Misaki is right. We should be cautious. @Toshio, who will you check next?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Minato,,I trust Toshio-san. He seems very kind and honest.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I find the atmosphere becoming tense. Let us remain composed.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will decide my next target based on the reactions here.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Minato, you seem very quick to trust. Why is that?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Minato's nature is simply trusting. However, we must look for contradictions.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Minato,,I just... I feel like Toshio-san wants to help us. Is that wrong?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Trust is a fragile thing, but necessary.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I believe we should consider who is being too quiet or too supportive.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll keep observing. I don't have enough evidence to vote yet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I think we should trust the Seer for now to maintain momentum.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll vote with the group. I hope we make the right choice.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will follow the consensus of the village.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
